---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Container from '../components/layout/Container.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
import { breadcrumbs, ORG_ID } from '../lib/seo';

// The page node is the ContactPage, and its subject is the sitewide
// Organization node (which already carries the email and contact point).
const jsonLd = [breadcrumbs([{ name: 'Contact', href: '/contact' }])];
---

<Layout
  title="Contact"
  description="Contact Webcam Test, report a bug, ask a question about a camera or microphone problem, or send feedback by email."
  pageType="ContactPage"
  pageExtra={{ mainEntity: { '@id': ORG_ID } }}
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
  <Container class="py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <p class="caption-mono uppercase text-mute">Contact</p>
      <h1 class="display-xl mt-3 text-ink">Get in touch.</h1>
      <p class="body-lg mt-6 text-body">
        There is no form here, and no ticket queue, just a mailbox that a person reads. Write to
        us about anything on {SITE.name}: a camera that behaves strangely, a measurement that
        looks wrong, or a tool you wish existed.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft p-6">
        <p class="caption-mono uppercase text-mute">Email</p>
        <p class="body-lg mt-3">
          <a class="text-link hover:text-link-deep" href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>
        </p>
        <p class="body-sm mt-3 text-body">
          We read every message and reply to the ones that need a reply, usually within a few
          working days.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2 class="display-md mt-12 text-ink">Reporting a problem</h2>
      <p class="body-md mt-4 text-body">
        Camera problems are hard to reproduce blind, so the more of this you can include, the
        faster we can fix it:
      </p>
      <ul class="body-md mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 ps-5 text-body">
        <li>Your browser and version, and your operating system.</li>
        <li>The camera or microphone make and model, and whether it is built in or plugged in.</li>
        <li>Which page you were on and what you expected to happen instead.</li>
        <li>The diagnostics report from the test page, it collects the technical detail for you.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="body-md mt-4 text-body">
        Please never send us photos or video from your camera. We do not need them, and this site
        is built so that your feed never leaves your device, see our{' '}
        <a class="text-link hover:text-link-deep" href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="display-md mt-10 text-ink">Before you write</h2>
      <p class="body-md mt-4 text-body">
        Most camera and microphone issues come down to a permission, a device that another app is
        holding open, or a driver. Our{' '}
        <a class="text-link hover:text-link-deep" href="/troubleshooting">troubleshooting guide</a>{' '}
        walks through those with the exact settings path for each browser and operating system,
        and the <a class="text-link hover:text-link-deep" href="/faq">FAQ</a> answers the
        questions we are asked most often.
      </p>

      <h2 class="display-md mt-10 text-ink">Privacy, legal and everything else</h2>
      <p class="body-md mt-4 text-body">
        Questions about how your data is handled belong on the{' '}
        <a class="text-link hover:text-link-deep" href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>, and the{' '}
        <a class="text-link hover:text-link-deep" href="/terms">terms of use</a> cover the legal
        side. If either leaves something unclear, the same address above reaches us mentioning
        which page you mean helps it get to the right place.
      </p>

      <h2 class="display-md mt-10 text-ink">Feedback and ideas</h2>
      <p class="body-md mt-4 text-body">
        {SITE.name} exists because the alternatives were slow and full of ads. If something here
        is still in your way, or a check you rely on is missing, we would like to hear it. Read
        more about the thinking behind the site on the{' '}
        <a class="text-link hover:text-link-deep" href="/about">about page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Container>
</Layout>
